  $$https://picsum.photos/seed/demo-daniel-whitfield-okoro/800/200$$,
  $$Daniel Whitfield Okoro is a data scientist working on crisis and conflict analytics. In three years he has built Python pipelines that combine conflict event data, displacement figures and food prices, developed web dashboards for humanitarian coordination teams, and managed databases for a conflict early-warning project. He has worked with a UN data team and a university research lab on fragility indicators. Daniel enjoys building tools that non-technical colleagues can use and is looking for remote data roles with humanitarian and peacebuilding organizations. He also maps conflict events and builds early warning models for preventing violence.$$,
